es!", "tokens": [51275, 6622, 68, 281, 291, 11, 39435, 279, 293, 47742, 279, 11, 50207, 30931, 0, 51490], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18539408729189918, "compression_ratio": 1.7989417989417988, "no_speech_prob": 0.004607368726283312}, {"id": 39, "seek": 14778, "start": 171.02, "end": 173.94, "text": " For you tithe mint and dill and cumin,", "tokens": [51527, 1171, 291, 256, 45381, 18189, 293, 274, 373, 293, 40950, 11, 51673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18539408729189918, "compression_ratio": 1.7989417989417988, "no_speech_prob": 0.004607368726283312}, {"id": 40, "seek": 14778, "start": 173.94, "end": 177.76, "text": " and have neglected the weightier matters of the law,", "tokens": [51673, 293, 362, 32701, 264, 3364, 811, 7001, 295, 264, 2101, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18539408729189918, "compression_ratio": 1.7989417989417988, "no_speech_prob": 0.004607368726283312}, {"id": 41, "seek": 17778, "start": 178.74, "end": 181.4, "text": " justice and mercy and faithfulness.", "tokens": [50413, 6118, 293, 13174, 293, 17808, 1287, 13, 50546], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20995712280273438, "compression_ratio": 1.5488372093023255, "no_speech_prob": 0.001314575900323689}, {"id": 42, "seek": 17778, "start": 181.88, "end": 186.14, "text": " These you ought to have done, without neglecting the others.", "tokens": [50570, 1981, 291, 13416, 281, 362, 1096, 11, 1553, 17745, 278, 264, 2357, 13, 50783], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20995712280273438, "compression_ratio": 1.5488372093023255, "no_speech_prob": 0.001314575900323689}, {"id": 43, "seek": 17778, "start": 187.54, "end": 189.36, "text": " You blind guides!", "tokens": [50853, 509, 6865, 17007, 0, 50944], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20995712280273438, "compression_ratio": 1.5488372093023255, "no_speech_prob": 0.001314575900323689}, {"id": 44, "seek": 17778, "start": 190.02, "end": 192.6, "text": " Straining out a gnat and swallowing a camel?", "tokens": [50977, 12875, 1760, 484, 257, 290, 12241, 293, 1693, 336, 9637, 257, 37755, 30, 51106], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20995712280273438, "compression_ratio": 1.5488372093023255, "no_speech_prob": 0.001314575900323689}, {"id": 45, "seek": 17778, "start": 193.48, "end": 197.02, "text": " Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites!", "tokens": [51150, 6622, 68, 281, 291, 11, 39435, 279, 293, 47742, 279, 11, 50207, 30931, 0, 51327], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20995712280273438, "compression_ratio": 1.5488372093023255, "no_speech_prob": 0.001314575900323689}, {"id": 46, "seek": 17778, "start": 197.52, "end": 200.2, "text": " For you clean the outside of the cup and the plate,", "tokens": [51352, 1171, 291, 2541, 264, 2380, 295, 264, 4414, 293, 264, 5924, 11, 51486], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20995712280273438, "compression_ratio": 1.5488372093023255, "no_speech_prob": 0.001314575900323689}, {"id": 47, "seek": 17778, "start": 200.2, "end": 204.38, "text": " but inside they are full of greed and self-indulgence.", "tokens": [51486, 457, 1854, 436, 366, 1577, 295, 29230, 293, 2698, 12, 471, 425, 15260, 13, 51695], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20995712280273438, "compression_ratio": 1.5488372093023255, "no_speech_prob": 0.001314575900323689}, {"id": 48, "seek": 17778, "start": 205.86, "end": 207.2, "text": " You blind Pharisee!", "tokens": [51769, 509, 6865, 47742, 68, 0, 51836], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20995712280273438, "compression_ratio": 1.5488372093023255, "no_speech_prob": 0.001314575900323689}, {"id": 49, "seek": 20778, "start": 207.78, "end": 210.66, "text": " First clean the inside of the cup and the plate,", "tokens": [50365, 2386, 2541, 264, 1854, 295, 264, 4414, 293, 264, 5924, 11, 50509], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17396767625530946, "compression_ratio": 1.7083333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.00019259030523244292}, {"id": 50, "seek": 20778, "start": 210.86, "end": 213.28, "text": " that the outside also may be clean.", "tokens": [50519, 300, 264, 2380, 611, 815, 312, 2541, 13, 50640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17396767625530946, "compression_ratio": 1.7083333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.00019259030523244292}, {"id": 51, "seek": 20778, "start": 214.22, "end": 218.08, "text": " Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites!", "tokens": [50687, 6622, 68, 281, 291, 11, 39435, 279, 293, 47742, 279, 11, 50207, 30931, 0, 50880], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17396767625530946, "compression_ratio": 1.7083333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.00019259030523244292}, {"id": 52, "seek": 20778, "start": 219.04, "end": 221.9, "text": " For you are like whitewashed tombs,", "tokens": [50928, 1171, 291, 366, 411, 2418, 86, 12219, 2916, 929, 11, 51071], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17396767625530946, "compression_ratio": 1.7083333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.00019259030523244292}, {"id": 53, "seek": 20778, "start": 222.14, "end": 224.08, "text": " which outwardly appear beautiful,", "tokens": [51083, 597, 26914, 356, 4204, 2238, 11, 51180], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17396767625530946, "compression_ratio": 1.7083333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.00019259030523244292}, {"id": 54, "seek": 20778, "start": 224.72, "end": 229.1, "text": " but within are full of dead people's bones and all uncleanness.", "tokens": [51212, 457, 1951, 366, 1577, 295, 3116, 561, 311, 10491, 293, 439, 9153, 969, 442, 13, 51431], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17396767625530946, "compression_ratio": 1.7083333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.00019259030523244292}, {"id": 55, "seek": 20778, "start": 229.68, "end": 233.3, "text": " So you also outwardly appear righteous to others,", "tokens": [51460, 407, 291, 611, 26914, 356, 4204, 16153, 281, 2357, 11, 51641], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17396767625530946, "compression_ratio": 1.7083333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.00019259030523244292}, {"id": 56, "seek": 20778, "start": 233.7, "end": 237.46, "text": " but within you are full of hypocrisy and lawlessness.", "tokens": [51661, 457, 1951, 291, 366, 1577, 295, 39419, 14169, 293, 2101, 26663, 13, 51849], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17396767625530946, "compression_ratio": 1.7083333333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.00019259030523244292}, {"id": 57, "seek": 23778, "start": 238.74, "end": 243.02, "text": " Woe to you, scribes and Pharisees, hypocrites!", "tokens": [50413, 6622, 68, 281, 291, 11, 39435, 279, 293, 47742, 279, 11, 50207, 30931, 0, 50627], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22370071764345523, "compression_ratio": 1.688034188034188, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018668213160708547}, {"id": 58, "seek": 23778, "start": 244.02, "end": 246.3, "text": " For you build the tombs of the prophets", "tokens": [50677, 1171, 291, 1322, 264, 2916, 929, 295, 264, 27297, 50791], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22370071764345523, "compression_ratio": 1.688034188034188, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018668213160708547}, {"id": 59, "seek": 23778, "start": 246.3, "end": 248.84, "text": " and decorate the monuments of the righteous,", "tokens": [50791, 293, 24229, 264, 36864, 295, 264, 16153, 11, 50918], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22370071764345523, "compression_ratio": 1.688034188034188, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018668213160708547}, {"id": 60, "seek": 23778, "start": 249.46, "end": 249.82, "text": " saying,", "tokens": [50949, 1566, 11, 50967], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22370071764345523, "compression_ratio": 1.688034188034188, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018668213160708547}, {"id": 61, "seek": 23778, "start": 250.3, "end": 252.9, "text": " If we had lived in the days of our fathers,", "tokens": [50991, 759, 321, 632, 5152, 294, 264, 1708, 295, 527, 23450, 11, 51121], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22370071764345523, "compression_ratio": 1.688034188034188, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018668213160708547}, {"id": 62, "seek": 23778, "start": 253.24, "end": 255.26, "text": " we would not have taken part with them", "tokens": [51138, 321, 576, 406, 362, 2726, 644, 365, 552, 51239], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22370071764345523, "compression_ratio": 1.688034188034188, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018668213160708547}, {"id": 63, "seek": 23778, "start": 255.26, "end": 257.06, "text": " in shedding the blood of the prophets.", "tokens": [51239, 294, 49934, 264, 3390, 295, 264, 27297, 13, 51329], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22370071764345523, "compression_ratio": 1.688034188034188, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018668213160708547}, {"id": 64, "seek": 23778, "start": 258.2, "end": 260.64, "text": " Thus you witness against yourselves", "tokens": [51386, 13827, 291, 7286, 1970, 14791, 51508], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22370071764345523, "compression_ratio": 1.688034188034188, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018668213160708547}, {"id": 65, "seek": 23778, "start": 260.64, "end": 263.76, "text": " that you are sons of those who murdered the prophets.", "tokens": [51508, 300, 291, 366, 13476, 295, 729, 567, 18486, 264, 27297, 13, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22370071764345523, "compression_ratio": 1.688034188034188, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018668213160708547}, {"id": 66, "seek": 23778, "start": 264.48, "end": 266.56, "text": " Fill up, then, the measure of your fathers.", "tokens": [51700, 25315, 493, 11, 550, 11, 264, 3481, 295, 428, 23450, 13, 51804], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22370071764345523, "compression_ratio": 1.688034188034188, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018668213160708547}, {"id": 67, "seek": 26778, "start": 267.78, "end": 269.58, "text": " You serpents!", "tokens": [50365, 509, 816, 79, 791, 0, 50455], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13957110047340393, "compression_ratio": 1.6829268292682926, "no_speech_prob": 0.012717796489596367}, {"id": 68, "seek": 26778, "start": 270.05999999999995, "end": 271.44, "text": " You brood of vipers!", "tokens": [50479, 509, 2006, 378, 295, 371, 647, 433, 0, 50548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13957110047340393, "compression_ratio": 1.6829268292682926, "no_speech_prob": 0.012717796489596367}, {"id": 69, "seek": 26778, "start": 271.97999999999996, "end": 274.84, "text": " How are you to escape being sentenced to hell?", "tokens": [50575, 1012, 366, 291, 281, 7615, 885, 30954, 281, 4921, 30, 50718], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13957110047340393, "compression_ratio": 1.6829268292682926, "no_speech_prob": 0.012717796489596367}, {"id": 70, "seek": 26778, "start": 275.53999999999996, "end": 279.2, "text": " Therefore I send you prophets and wise men and scribes,", "tokens": [50753, 7504, 286, 2845, 291, 27297, 293, 10829, 1706, 293, 39435, 279, 11, 50936], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13957110047340393, "compression_ratio": 1.6829268292682926, "no_speech_prob": 0.012717796489596367}, {"id": 71, "seek": 26778, "start": 279.44, "end": 281.84, "text": " some of whom you will kill and crucify,", "tokens": [50948, 512, 295, 7101, 291, 486, 1961, 293, 28154, 2505, 11, 51068], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13957110047340393, "compression_ratio": 1.6829268292682926, "no_speech_prob": 0.012717796489596367}, {"id": 72, "seek": 26778, "start": 281.84, "end": 284.73999999999995, "text": " and some you will flog in your synagogues", "tokens": [51068, 293, 512, 291, 486, 932, 664, 294, 428, 5451, 31599, 1247, 51213], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13957110047340393, "compression_ratio": 1.6829268292682926, "no_speech_prob": 0.012717796489596367}, {"id": 73, "seek": 26778, "start": 284.73999999999995, "end": 286.91999999999996, "text": " and persecute from town to town,", "tokens": [51213, 293, 23783, 1169, 490, 3954, 281, 3954, 11, 51322], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13957110047340393, "compression_ratio": 1.6829268292682926, "no_speech_prob": 0.012717796489596367}, {"id": 74, "seek": 26778, "start": 287.38, "end": 291.14, "text": " so that on you may come all the righteous blood shed on earth,", "tokens": [51345, 370, 300, 322, 291, 815, 808, 439, 264, 16153, 3390, 14951, 322, 4120, 11, 51533], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13957110047340393, "compression_ratio": 1.6829268292682926, "no_speech_prob": 0.012717796489596367}, {"id": 75, "seek": 26778, "start": 291.34, "end": 293.28, "text": " from the blood of innocent Abel", "tokens": [51543, 490, 264, 3390, 295, 13171, 2847, 338, 51640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13957110047340393, "compression_ratio": 1.6829268292682926, "no_speech_prob": 0.012717796489596367}, {"id": 76, "seek": 26778, "start": 293.28, "end": 296.23999999999995, "text": " to the blood of Zechariah the son of Berechiah,", "tokens": [51640, 281, 264, 3390, 295, 4853, 339, 3504, 545, 264, 1872, 295, 17684, 8036, 545, 11, 51788], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13957110047340393, "compression_ratio": 1.6829268292682926, "no_speech_prob": 0.012717796489596367}, {"id": 77, "seek": 26778, "start": 296.35999999999996, "end": 297.46, "text": " whom you murdered,", "tokens": [51794, 7101, 291, 18486, 11, 51849], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13957110047340393, "compression_ratio": 1.6829268292682926, "no_speech_prob": 0.012717796489596367}, {"id": 78, "seek": 29746, "start": 297.46, "end": 299.65999999999997, "text": " between the sanctuary and the altar.", "tokens": [50365, 1296, 264, 34390, 293, 264, 31435, 13, 50475], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 79, "seek": 29746, "start": 300.47999999999996, "end": 302.0, "text": " Truly I say to you,", "tokens": [50516, 43548, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 50592], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 80, "seek": 29746, "start": 302.28, "end": 305.38, "text": " all these things will come upon this generation.", "tokens": [50606, 439, 613, 721, 486, 808, 3564, 341, 5125, 13, 50761], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 81, "seek": 29746, "start": 306.56, "end": 308.34, "text": " O Jerusalem!", "tokens": [50820, 422, 15393, 0, 50909], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 82, "seek": 29746, "start": 309.23999999999995, "end": 309.96, "text": " Jerusalem!", "tokens": [50954, 15393, 0, 50990], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 83, "seek": 29746, "start": 310.9, "end": 312.85999999999996, "text": " The city that kills the prophets", "tokens": [51037, 440, 2307, 300, 14563, 264, 27297, 51135], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 84, "seek": 29746, "start": 312.85999999999996, "end": 315.56, "text": " and stones those who are sent to it!", "tokens": [51135, 293, 14083, 729, 567, 366, 2279, 281, 309, 0, 51270], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 85, "seek": 29746, "start": 316.29999999999995, "end": 319.32, "text": " How often would I have gathered your children together", "tokens": [51307, 1012, 2049, 576, 286, 362, 13032, 428, 2227, 1214, 51458], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 86, "seek": 29746, "start": 319.32, "end": 322.46, "text": " as a hen gathers her brood under her wings,", "tokens": [51458, 382, 257, 22253, 290, 11850, 720, 2006, 378, 833, 720, 11405, 11, 51615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 87, "seek": 29746, "start": 323.03999999999996, "end": 324.35999999999996, "text": " and you would not!", "tokens": [51644, 293, 291, 576, 406, 0, 51710], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 88, "seek": 29746, "start": 325.56, "end": 326.03999999999996, "text": " See,", "tokens": [51770, 3008, 11, 51794], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 89, "seek": 29746, "start": 326.03999999999996, "end": 327.03999999999996, "text": " your house,", "tokens": [51794, 428, 1782, 11, 51844], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2668436789999203, "compression_ratio": 1.568075117370892, "no_speech_prob": 0.000440750241978094}, {"id": 90, "seek": 32746, "start": 327.46, "end": 329.08, "text": " is left to you desolate.", "tokens": [50365, 307, 1411, 281, 291, 730, 48278, 13, 50446], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.517735481262207, "compression_ratio": 1.2476190476190476, "no_speech_prob": 0.0036179854068905115}, {"id": 91, "seek": 32746, "start": 330.15999999999997, "end": 331.23999999999995, "text": " For I tell you,", "tokens": [50500, 1171, 286, 980, 291, 11, 50554], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.517735481262207, "compression_ratio": 1.2476190476190476, "no_speech_prob": 0.0036179854068905115}, {"id": 92, "seek": 32746, "start": 331.7, "end": 333.46, "text": " you will not see me again,", "tokens": [50577, 291, 486, 406, 536, 385, 797, 11, 50665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.517735481262207, "compression_ratio": 1.2476190476190476, "no_speech_prob": 0.0036179854068905115}, {"id": 93, "seek": 32746, "start": 333.76, "end": 334.96, "text": " until you say,", "tokens": [50680, 1826, 291, 584, 11, 50740], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.517735481262207, "compression_ratio": 1.2476190476190476, "no_speech_prob": 0.0036179854068905115}, {"id": 94, "seek": 32746, "start": 335.5, "end": 338.91999999999996, "text": " Blessed is he who comes in the name of the Lord.", "tokens": [50767, 37501, 307, 415, 567, 1487, 294, 264, 1315, 295, 264, 3257, 13, 50938], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.517735481262207, "compression_ratio": 1.2476190476190476, "no_speech_prob": 0.0036179854068905115}], "language": "English"}